# S3 fixture ("created as Excel shows it"): data validation through s3-data's Data Validation (its
# script op on the selection, as the panel sets it): whole numbers between, decimals greater than,
# dates between, a text length, a list, times before, a custom formula. Values and dates typed in the
# en-NL region; Excel gives a list's items with the region's separator, dates and times as this PC shows them.
# The columns are apart: Excel's read-back joins validations side by side into one area.
sheet-name "Entry"
enter A1 "Qty"
enter C1 "Price"
enter E1 "Date"
enter G1 "Code"
enter I1 "Status"
enter K1 "Start"
enter M1 "Ref"
width E 12
validation A2:A20 whole between "1" "100"
validation C2:C20 decimal greater "0"
validation E2:E20 date between "1-1-2026" "31-12-2026"
validation G2:G20 length lessequal "5"
validation I2:I20 list "Open|Closed|On hold"
validation K2:K20 time less "18:00"
validation M2:M20 custom "=ISNUMBER(M2)"
enter A2 "5"
enter C2 "2,5"
enter E2 "19-11-2026"
enter G2 "AB12"
enter I2 "Open"
enter K2 "9:30"
enter M2 "17"
save
expect validation Entry!A2:A20 type 1 1
expect validation Entry!A2:A20 operator 1 100
expect validation Entry!C2:C20 type 2 0
expect validation Entry!C2:C20 operator 5
expect validation Entry!E2:E20 type 4 01/01/2026
expect validation Entry!E2:E20 operator 1 31/12/2026
expect validation Entry!G2:G20 type 6 5
expect validation Entry!G2:G20 operator 8
expect validation Entry!I2:I20 type 3 Open;Closed;On hold
expect validation Entry!K2:K20 type 5 18:00:00
expect validation Entry!K2:K20 operator 6
expect validation Entry!M2:M20 type 7 =ISNUMBER(M2)
expect cell Entry!E2 text 19/11/2026
